---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use - TDEE Check"
  description="Terms of use for TDEE Check: free educational calculators, acceptable use, accuracy limits, and liability terms."
  path="/terms/"
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Terms of Use', path: '/terms/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      By using TDEE Check you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">What the site provides</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      TDEE Check provides free online calculators and educational articles about calorie needs, macros, and body weight.
      Results are estimates generated by published formulas. They are provided for general information only, as described
      in our <a class="font-bold text-brand-700 underline" href="/medical-disclaimer/">medical disclaimer</a>, and are not
      a substitute for professional advice.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6">
      <li>Use the calculators for your own personal planning.</li>
      <li>Do not attempt to disrupt, overload, or reverse engineer the site or its hosting.</li>
      <li>Do not present results from this site as medical advice to others.</li>
      <li>Do not scrape content at scale or republish our articles without permission.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Accuracy and availability</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      We work to keep formulas and content accurate, but we do not guarantee that results are correct for any individual
      or that the site will always be available or error free. The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any
      kind.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      To the fullest extent allowed by law, TDEE Check and its reviewers are not liable for any loss or damage arising
      from use of this site or reliance on its results. Decisions about your diet and health remain yours, ideally made
      with a qualified professional who knows your history.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">External links and changes</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      Links to third party sites are provided for convenience and do not imply endorsement. We may update these terms
      from time to time; continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated terms. Questions can be
      sent through the <a class="font-bold text-brand-700 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
